        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Citations (as built)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Filter chain order and 401 entry point: api/src/main/java/app/todo/config/SecurityConfig.java:L52-L60.&lt;br&gt;Cookie to CurrentUser principal: api/src/main/java/app/todo/auth/SessionCookieAuthenticationFilter.java:L37-L54.&lt;br&gt;AuthController operations: api/src/main/java/app/todo/auth/AuthController.java:L34-L59; AuthService: AuthService.java:L31-L111.&lt;br&gt;SessionService (SHA-256 token hash, 8 h): api/src/main/java/app/todo/auth/SessionService.java:L16-L62.&lt;br&gt;TodoController: api/src/main/java/app/todo/todo/TodoController.java:L24-L74; TodoService: TodoService.java:L17-L60.&lt;br&gt;Owner-scoped repository contract: api/src/main/java/app/todo/todo/TodoRepository.java:L11-L32.&lt;br&gt;Single DataSource, pool of 1: api/src/main/java/app/todo/config/DatabaseConfig.java:L19-L39." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
